2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> which is a hyperbola. </p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>So, only statements I and III are true.</p>\n</div></div>",
